Package: mongolstats
Type: Package
Title: Tidy Client for the Mongolian 'NSO' 'PXWeb' Statistics API
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R:
    c(person(given = "Temuulen",
             family = "Enebish",
             role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
             email = "temuulen@gmail.com"))
Description: A 'tidyverse'-friendly client for the 'PXWeb' API of the
    National Statistics Office of Mongolia <https://data.1212.mn/>. Discover
    tables and their dimensions, and fetch statistical data as tibbles with
    English or Mongolian labels. Periods are reported by their labels and
    can be selected in any of the office's period formats, tables that have
    moved within the catalogue are found automatically, and large requests
    are split to stay within the server's limits. Maps and joins by
    statistical code are provided by the companion package 'mongolmaps'.
